MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_m01_01: A rare moment of rest.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_m01_02: I feel as though I could ascend to the heavens.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_m01_03: I feel at peace.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai0_m01_01: Ahhh... My body's completely relaxed.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai0_m01_02: Kinda...makes you sleepy.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai0_m01_03: Just being here calms me.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai1_m01_01: Let the tension just roll away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai1_m01_02: Ahh... So soothing.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai1_m01_03: Now this is relaxing.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dit_m01_01: Watch as the blood washes away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dit_m01_02: A bath quiets the mind.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dit_m01_03: This place is suited to meditation.
MID_SV_Thermae_Seo_m01_01: A rest would not go amiss.
MID_SV_Thermae_Seo_m01_02: This water warms me to the core.
MID_SV_Thermae_Seo_m01_03: Nothing great was ever accomplished without rest.
MID_SV_Thermae_Led_m01_01: Steam's good for the vocal cords.
MID_SV_Thermae_Led_m01_02: Ahh, I feel as if I could melt away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Led_m01_03: Have to knead out the muscle tension.
MID_SV_Thermae_Bel_m01_01: Eases the tension, doesn't it?
MID_SV_Thermae_Bel_m01_02: We can't afford fatigue, in mind or body.
MID_SV_Thermae_Bel_m01_03: One has to relax once in a while. The body—\nthe soul—they need it.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tal_m01_01: Oh, yeah, this'll set me right for sure...
MID_SV_Thermae_Tal_m01_02: The water's perfect.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tal_m01_03: You can come up with all kinds of good ideas in here.
MID_SV_Thermae_Anh_m01_01: This should be relaxing.
MID_SV_Thermae_Anh_m01_02: It's warm... Reminds me of my culture vat.
MID_SV_Thermae_Anh_m01_03: These waters are good for stilling the mind.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia0_m01_01: Ohhh, feels good.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia0_m01_02: The warmth soaks right into your bones.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia0_m01_03: Sometimes it's nice to clear your mind and heal.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia1_m01_01: All the weariness drifts away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia1_m01_02: It's like I could just forget all my worries.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia1_m01_03: Looks like this place is ideal for a break.
MID_SV_Thermae_Pet0_m01_01: Ohhh. Now that's a good feeling.
MID_SV_Thermae_Pet0_m01_02: I'm so calm I could fall asleep.
MID_SV_Thermae_Pet0_m01_03: Nice cozy place, eh?
MID_SV_Thermae_Pet1_m01_01: Ahhh, this is the life.
MID_SV_Thermae_Pet1_m01_02: Warm and fuzzy in body and mind? Check.
MID_SV_Thermae_Pet1_m01_03: Feels like the place to unwind.
MID_SV_Thermae_Hur_m01_01: Ahhh. Oh, it feels great.
MID_SV_Thermae_Hur_m01_02: There goes my fatigue. Bye, fatigue!
MID_SV_Thermae_Hur_m01_03: This is just so relaxing.
MID_SV_Thermae_Max_m01_01: I guess I don't have to worry about make-up.\nHehe. That's nice!
MID_SV_Thermae_Max_m01_02: Makes me nervous, going to the bath.
MID_SV_Thermae_Max_m01_03: It's so nice, resting. Letting my body relax.
MID_SV_Thermae_Jes_m01_01: The blood runs, the make-up doesn't. Hehe!\nGot a problem with that?
MID_SV_Thermae_Jes_m01_02: Ngaaah! You sure about this steam?
MID_SV_Thermae_Jes_m01_03: Guess it doesn't hurt to relax now and again.
MID_SV_Thermae_Gol_m01_01: *yawn* Getting sleepy.
MID_SV_Thermae_Gol_m01_02: Nothing like a soak after a good workout! Feel it in\nyour bones.
MID_SV_Thermae_Gol_m01_03: Couldn't have made it a bit wider?
MID_SV_Thermae_Gat_m01_01: The baths in Sai—they were hot as flames.
MID_SV_Thermae_Gat_m01_02: The relaxation. The serenity.
MID_SV_Thermae_Gat_m01_03: So pleasant, the steam—like I'm in a misty forest.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dan_m01_01: Oh, bless these bracing vapors! My eyes were so dry.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dan_m01_02: Soul and body coalesce.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dan_m01_03: *yawn* I didn't start dreaming again, did I?
MID_SV_Thermae_Fab_m01_01: My dry skin craves moisture.
MID_SV_Thermae_Fab_m01_02: Tall enough to be forced to look down on everything\nand everyone... Ah, this soothes my neck.
MID_SV_Thermae_Fab_m01_03: Skin requires regular cleaning and maintenance.
MID_SV_Thermae_Esm_m01_01: I want to swim. I'd better not, right?
MID_SV_Thermae_Esm_m01_02: This has nothing on the sea.
MID_SV_Thermae_Esm_m01_03: Time for a nice beauty scrub!
MID_SV_Thermae_Mic_m01_01: I have fond memories of bathing with my kid.
MID_SV_Thermae_Mic_m01_02: So many people use these...must be a big job to keep\nthem clean!
MID_SV_Thermae_Mic_m01_03: Work hard, and then relax.
MID_SV_Thermae_Urs_m01_01: Finally, a moment to relax my eyes.
MID_SV_Thermae_Urs_m01_02: It feels so good to get clean again.
MID_SV_Thermae_Urs_m01_03: Self-care is part of the job too.
MID_SV_Thermae_Sim_m01_01: Mmm. Oh, yeah, that's the stuff...
MID_SV_Thermae_Sim_m01_02: Feels good to rest up after a hard day...
MID_SV_Thermae_Sim_m01_03: Plenty of worse ways to decompress, that's for sure...
MID_SV_Thermae_Lou_m01_01: It's like all my stress just melts away...
MID_SV_Thermae_Lou_m01_02: Can't I just drift in here forever?
MID_SV_Thermae_Lou_m01_03: Gotta make sure to get behind the ears!
MID_SV_Thermae_Fia_m01_01: Oh... The heat is making my head spin...
MID_SV_Thermae_Fia_m01_02: Ahh... The water's just right.
MID_SV_Thermae_Fia_m01_03: I've carried this scar for a while now...
MID_SV_Thermae_Die_m01_01: Huh... Kind of eases you up at your core...
MID_SV_Thermae_Die_m01_02: Hmph. Not bad...
MID_SV_Thermae_Die_m01_03: Mmm. Loosens the tension in the shoulders...
MID_SV_Thermae_Lor0_m01_01: Ohhh. I feel like I could just float away...
MID_SV_Thermae_Lor0_m01_02: I could sit in here forever...
MID_SV_Thermae_Lor0_m01_03: This place is sooo relaxing.
MID_SV_Thermae_Lor1_m01_01: *sigh* This is really, really nice.
MID_SV_Thermae_Lor1_m01_02: This kind of heat does wonders for me.
MID_SV_Thermae_Lor1_m01_03: Totally and completely relaxing.
MID_SV_Thermae_Set_m01_01: A balm for the spirit, no doubt...
MID_SV_Thermae_Set_m01_02: Ah. I can't imagine anything nicer for those who've\ntraveled a long way.
MID_SV_Thermae_Set_m01_03: Very agreeable, isn't it?
MID_SV_Thermae_Nin_m01_01: I could just drift off... Far, far away...
MID_SV_Thermae_Nin_m01_02: Ahhh. The spirits are very content here.
MID_SV_Thermae_Nin_m01_03: Relax, and let it carry you away...
MID_SV_Thermae_Bon_m01_01: A soak will do these old bones good.
MID_SV_Thermae_Bon_m01_02: Ahhh. Exactly what I needed.
MID_SV_Thermae_Bon_m01_03: Ahhh. What a pleasant spot.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tob_m01_01: I'm so relaxed I might nod off.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tob_m01_02: The tension just melts away, don't it?
MID_SV_Thermae_Tob_m01_03: Hoooo...
MID_SV_Thermae_Lil_m01_01: Ahhh. I feel alive again.
MID_SV_Thermae_Lil_m01_02: Bye-bye, tension.
MID_SV_Thermae_Lil_m01_03: Can't work hard all the time, am I right?
MID_SV_Thermae_Lys_m01_01: This is nice and comfortable.
MID_SV_Thermae_Lys_m01_02: Nothing like full-body relaxation...
MID_SV_Thermae_Lys_m01_03: This really is quite pleasant.
MID_SV_Thermae_Buc_m01_01: I can feel years of stiffness melt away...
MID_SV_Thermae_Buc_m01_02: I didn't even know how fatigued I was.
MID_SV_Thermae_Buc_m01_03: What better place for a rest?
MID_SV_Thermae_Sci_m01_01: A little respite can lighten the mood.
MID_SV_Thermae_Sci_m01_02: Misty zephyrs, blowing the dust away...
MID_SV_Thermae_Sci_m01_03: The softness of the steam invites one to sleep...
MID_SV_Thermae_Moo0_m01_01: This is just like bathtime when I was a kid...
MID_SV_Thermae_Moo0_m01_02: It's like my body is weightless...
MID_SV_Thermae_Moo0_m01_03: Kinda relaxing, huh?
MID_SV_Thermae_Moo1_m01_01: I feel like I'm getting cooked, in the best way.
MID_SV_Thermae_Moo1_m01_02: I'd love a house with a tub like this.
MID_SV_Thermae_Moo1_m01_03: So calming...
MID_SV_Thermae_Oly_m01_01: After my bath, I'll pick out a nice perfumed oil...
MID_SV_Thermae_Oly_m01_02: The steam, it makes one's whole body feel\nmoisturized!
MID_SV_Thermae_Oly_m01_03: A flower does not bloom without adequate care...
MID_SV_Thermae_Naz_m01_01: Ahhh. I wouldn't mind falling asleep in here.
MID_SV_Thermae_Naz_m01_02: This is great for my aching muscles.
MID_SV_Thermae_Naz_m01_03: Treat your body right, and it'll do the same.
MID_SV_Thermae_Sar_m01_01: Ahhh. I can feel the water soaking in.
MID_SV_Thermae_Sar_m01_02: My body and spirit feel light as a feather.
MID_SV_Thermae_Sar_m01_03: It's a rare gift to get to use this much water.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dai_m01_01: Woo-hoo! Man, this is what I needed!
MID_SV_Thermae_Dai_m01_02: All that tiredness is washing away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dai_m01_03: *yawn* This is a little too relaxing.
MID_SV_Thermae_Hal_m01_01: Ahhh. I feel all...floaty.
MID_SV_Thermae_Hal_m01_02: This is great. I don't have a care in the world.
MID_SV_Thermae_Hal_m01_03: Ahhh. This is doing wonders for my tension.
MID_SV_Thermae_Guj_m01_01: Ahhh. Stings the ol' scars.
MID_SV_Thermae_Guj_m01_02: Ohhh. I'd love to relax with a drink!
MID_SV_Thermae_Guj_m01_03: If you want to stay sharp, you need to take it\neasy sometimes.
MID_SV_Thermae_Yan_m01_01: After a nice hot bath, a cool drink!
MID_SV_Thermae_Yan_m01_02: Nice and nearly scalding.
MID_SV_Thermae_Yan_m01_03: Moments like these are to be savored.
MID_SV_Thermae_Iio_m01_01: Refreshed, body and soul.
MID_SV_Thermae_Iio_m01_02: Totally revitalized.
MID_SV_Thermae_Iio_m01_03: A moment's peace...
MID_SV_Thermae_Pep_m01_01: To rest oneself is necessary.
MID_SV_Thermae_Pep_m01_02: A fine chance for rejuvenation.
MID_SV_Thermae_Pep_m01_03: We are grateful for this oasis of calm.
MID_SV_Thermae_Noc_m01_01: All my fatigue is melting away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Noc_m01_02: I could stay in this bath forever...
MID_SV_Thermae_Noc_m01_03: This bath is beautiful. Nothing like what I'm used to!
MID_SV_Thermae_Sop_m01_01: I just want to stretch out and relax.
MID_SV_Thermae_Sop_m01_02: I'll work up an appetite!
MID_SV_Thermae_Sop_m01_03: It would be nice if the steam was scented...like food.
MID_SV_Thermae_Cat_m01_01: Meticulous grooming helps set a sterling standard.
MID_SV_Thermae_Cat_m01_02: A nice bath leaves the skin glowing. Don't you agree?
MID_SV_Thermae_Cat_m01_03: Oh. Relaxed in mind and body.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ned_m01_01: My bruises are soothed.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ned_m01_02: The weariness of battle washes away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ned_m01_03: It is a relief to have these facilities.
MID_SV_Thermae_Zac_m01_01: Ahhh. Oh yeah. This is the best.
MID_SV_Thermae_Zac_m01_02: When I build my castle, I'll put in a bath just like\nthis one!
MID_SV_Thermae_Zac_m01_03: Finally, a breather.
MID_SV_Thermae_Maj_m01_01: I got the strength of 10 men, so go ahead and make\nit 10 times hotter!
MID_SV_Thermae_Maj_m01_02: Someday the great Majide will build his own baths.
MID_SV_Thermae_Maj_m01_03: Nice and toasty.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ven_m01_01: Hohhh... Feelin' waterlogged here.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ven_m01_02: Ahhh. Well, here we are.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ven_m01_03: Urghmph! Hate getting into and outta the bath...
MID_SV_Thermae_Ini_m01_01: So relaxed... So calm...
MID_SV_Thermae_Ini_m01_02: It feels like the tension's just melting away...
MID_SV_Thermae_Ini_m01_03: Need to really work out these knots...
MID_SV_Thermae_Jas_m01_01: A hot soak does a body good.
MID_SV_Thermae_Jas_m01_02: All my tension is just fading away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Jas_m01_03: It's good to take some time for yourself.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ale_m01_01: Ahh... Feels so good.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ale_m01_02: All my tension is just melting away...
MID_SV_Thermae_Ale_m01_03: This place is lovely, isn't it?
MID_SV_Thermae_Cle_m01_01: 
MID_SV_Thermae_Cle_m01_02: 
MID_SV_Thermae_Cle_m01_03: 
MID_SV_Thermae_Mys_m01_01: 
MID_SV_Thermae_Mys_m01_02: 
MID_SV_Thermae_Mys_m01_03: 
MID_SV_Thermae_Nat_m01_01: It's good to rest every so often.
MID_SV_Thermae_Nat_m01_02: I feel like I could float away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Nat_m01_03: Moments like these help us forget all the strife.
MID_SV_Thermae_Hri_m01_01: A rested body is a rested mind.
MID_SV_Thermae_Hri_m01_02: A good bath relaxes one down to the soul.
MID_SV_Thermae_Hri_m01_03: This warm is what I needed to relax.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tro_m01_01: Ahhh. I feel younger already.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tro_m01_02: Hooo... Sighing is part of the process.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tro_m01_03: It's the perfect place to take a break.
MID_SV_Thermae_Cen_m01_01: No matter how comfortable I am, I cannot relax.
MID_SV_Thermae_Cen_m01_02: Ah. That gets to the marrow.
MID_SV_Thermae_Cen_m01_03: This will make for good respite.
MID_SV_Thermae_Asw_m01_01: Ah, the fatigue... It melts away.
MID_SV_Thermae_Asw_m01_02: Forget everything and relax.
MID_SV_Thermae_Asw_m01_03: It feels like time passes more slowly here.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kou_m01_01: Here, I can truly know contentment.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kou_m01_02: Eh... Being relaxed makes me nervous.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kou_m01_03: It's as good a place as any for a rest.
MID_SV_Thermae_Nuz_m01_01: This will bring my body and mind in harmony.
MID_SV_Thermae_Nuz_m01_02: I feel my soul is ascending...
MID_SV_Thermae_Nuz_m01_03: It's peaceful here. Like sunlight through the trees.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kir_m01_01: Whenever I'm in the bath, I just gotta sing!\nAh—
MID_SV_Thermae_Kir_m01_02: Gonna doze off here...
MID_SV_Thermae_Kir_m01_03: Eek! A ghost! Oh, it was just steam.
MID_SV_Thermae_Iio_Pep_m01_01: If it is an ideal lord you seek, look to us! And if you\ndesire a position, you are welcome in Brigid.
MID_SV_Thermae_Iio_Pep_m01_02: I do not think so. But a sojourn outside Dagda could\nbe a worthy undertaking.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Anh_m01_01: I've been thinking that I'd like to remain close to you\nafter our mission is over.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Anh_m01_02: Let's take what time we can to let go of our fatigue.\nWe don't get many moments of tranquility.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Kai1_m01_01: When I think about the fighting ahead, sometimes I\ncan't sleep.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Kai1_m01_02: But knowing you'll be fighting with me gives \nme strength.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Seo_m01_01: You are free to relax. Try to forget that you are in\nthe presence of royalty.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Seo_m01_02: Let there be nothing between us. If you forget, I shall\nremind you as often as it takes.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Tal_m01_01: We have to turn that heroic frown upside down, my\nfriend! Brooding's no good for the soul, you know.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Tal_m01_02: C'mon, relax. Here—say it with me... "Ahhhhhhh..."\nHahaha. There you go.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Dit_m01_01: I sense in you a nobility that remains untainted. You\nare wholly pure.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Dit_m01_02: Never let yourself be sullied. Impurity will hinder\nour duel.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Bel_m01_01: Look at that. We found a place where we can relax—\nif only for a little.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Bel_m01_02: When we pull ourselves out of this water, the fight \ncontinues. And for the people, we have to win it.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Led_m01_01: As much as I try to focus on the battles at hand...\nat times, the magnitude of it all weighs on me.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_Led_m01_02: But when I'm with you, I feel the strength to\nkeep going. Let's continue our fight, Promised One.
MID_SV_Thermae_Urs_Jas_m01_01: Now that I get a good look at you, you're skin and\nbones! You could use a good meal.
MID_SV_Thermae_Urs_Jas_m01_02: I'm quite happy with my skin...and bones, if you can\nbelieve it. As it goes, too much is as bad as too little.
MID_SV_Thermae_Urs_Fia_m01_01: I have to tell you, Fianna, your poetry makes for \nsome exquisite relaxation reading.
MID_SV_Thermae_Urs_Fia_m01_02: R-really? Thank you, Ursula... In that case, I'd love\nto show you what I've been working on lately...
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai0_Gol_m01_01: Bwahaha! OK, Cai, contest! Let's see who can\nstay in longer.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai0_Gol_m01_02: You're on, Goliath. Loser takes on the winner's\ncleaning duties.
MID_SV_Thermae_Gat_Yan_m01_01: I heard some in the land of Sai refer to wine as\n"the warmest of water." Why was that?
MID_SV_Thermae_Gat_Yan_m01_02: Like a bath, it loosens the body and lulls you into a\ndreamlike state. There is wisdom in it, no?
MID_SV_Thermae_Sar_Kou_m01_01: I wish I could have spent more idyllic time with my\nson like this. Would you mind if I washed your back?
MID_SV_Thermae_Sar_Kou_m01_02: Of course you can, Hong Hua. As long as you let me\nreturn the favor.
MID_SV_Thermae_Sar_Hal_m01_01: Your skin is like silk, Sha Lan. It's beautiful.
MID_SV_Thermae_Sar_Hal_m01_02: I think yours is lovely too. Maybe that's one of the\nbenefits of these baths. Hehehe.
MID_SV_Thermae_Sim_Zac_m01_01: All this trouble to take a bath and you still look tense,\nZarcone. Try to relax, why don'tcha...
MID_SV_Thermae_Sim_Zac_m01_02: Hehe. Oh yeah, right. In a minute. Like I'd let my\nguard down, Sky-Drum Simon!
MID_SV_Thermae_Seo_Tro_m01_01: I remember many years ago when you almost\ndrowned in the tub and cried out for your Auntie.
MID_SV_Thermae_Seo_Tro_m01_02: You never tire of telling that story. I, for my part,\nam relieved to know my Auntie will never drown.
MID_SV_Thermae_Seo_Lil_m01_01: Your shoulders are so knotted. There is no rank or\nstatus in the bathhouse, so be at ease.
MID_SV_Thermae_Seo_Lil_m01_02: Well, if the queen says so, who am I to refuse?
MID_SV_Thermae_Dai_Ini_m01_01: Say, uhhh... Don't you worry about falling asleep in\nthe bath. I'll be right here to wake you up!
MID_SV_Thermae_Dai_Ini_m01_02: Oh, thanks. But you look ready to nod off yourself.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tal_Ini_m01_01: Ach! I know you. Workin' too hard, too much! You're\ngonna blow a gasket. Relax. Let your hair down!
MID_SV_Thermae_Tal_Ini_m01_02: All these others around, I'd be too frazzled. Gotta\nkeep up appearances. But, yeah, I hear ya.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tal_Sim_m01_01: Cut-throat kingpins, narrow escapes, you have a wild\nstory for everything, don'tcha, boss?
MID_SV_Thermae_Tal_Sim_m01_02: Hahaha! Simon, my friend, I haven't even told you\nthe half of it!
MID_SV_Thermae_Dan_Ned_m01_01: Your physique, it demands painstaking description!\nCould I examine you more closely?
MID_SV_Thermae_Dan_Ned_m01_02: You may. But it is a bit uncomfortable to be\nso scrutinized.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dan_Lou_m01_01: *gulp* Hmm... As the weather changes, so does the\ntaste of the water. Interesting!
MID_SV_Thermae_Dan_Lou_m01_02: You're...drinking our bath water? Are you sure that's\na good idea...
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia0_Hur_m01_01: Aw. My glasses are all fogged up. But if I take\nthem off, I can't see my own feet.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia0_Hur_m01_02: No worries, Tialla. I'll guide you.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dit_Set_m01_01: You speak at length... I shall leave now. Take care\nnot to succumb.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dit_Set_m01_02: What a shame. I had a point that I wanted to\nmake. Well, we can continue another time.
MID_SV_Thermae_Die_Set_m01_01: You stay on guard even here—in a place of\nrelaxation? You must get tired of being so vigilant.
MID_SV_Thermae_Die_Set_m01_02: Don't worry about me. This is the perfect place for\nan assassin to strike. You worry about you.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tob_Lys_m01_01: This feels too good. Makes me wanna doze off\nright here, right now.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tob_Lys_m01_02: Yes... No! You're a decorated hero. You can't be\nsleeping on the job!
MID_SV_Thermae_Naz_Maj_m01_01: Don't go splashing around. You runts are always\nmaking a fuss.
MID_SV_Thermae_Naz_Maj_m01_02: When did I splash? I've been sitting still like normal.\nDon't treat me like a punk kid!
MID_SV_Thermae_Nat_Hri_m01_01: You could stand to unwind a little more, Creek.\nIsn't that what the baths are for?
MID_SV_Thermae_Nat_Hri_m01_02: I assure you, I'm fully unwound. I do some of my best\nthinking in these hot waters.
MID_SV_Thermae_Fab_Esm_m01_01: Will you get lost? You gripe so much it's impossible\nto relax!
MID_SV_Thermae_Fab_Esm_m01_02: To call it mere griping is a misapprehension. If you\nperceive it so, you ought to frolic with the sea beasts.
MID_SV_Thermae_Fab_Cle_m01_01: Rrgh. A companion as vulgar as you will spoil\nmy hard-earned bath time.
MID_SV_Thermae_Fab_Cle_m01_02: Shut your yap or I'll give you something to whine\nabout. How about a nice drink of boiling water?
MID_SV_Thermae_Fia_Oly_m01_01: Your beauty, it is dazzling—beyond compare!\nIf only you would embrace it to its fullest!
MID_SV_Thermae_Fia_Oly_m01_02: Oh, Olympia, stop or you'll embarrass me...
MID_SV_Thermae_Bel_Gat_m01_01: Your body and soul rise with the boil... You watch\nthem pop like bubbles on the surface.
MID_SV_Thermae_Bel_Gat_m01_02: Meditation, is it? I'll take all the training I can get.
MID_SV_Thermae_Bel_Gol_m01_01: We worked too hard not to enjoy a nice bath!\nOh, uh... You got enough room?
MID_SV_Thermae_Bel_Gol_m01_02: I'm fine, Goliath! Relax. You're tired.
MID_SV_Thermae_Max_Gat_m01_01: When you talk about your training in the eastern\nlands, I feel like I should go there too.
MID_SV_Thermae_Max_Gat_m01_02: Then I'll tell you more about it. And you can feel\nready to go there whenever you'd like.
MID_SV_Thermae_Lou_Fia_m01_01: I got my hands on some amazing tea leaves. How\nabout you and me have a little tea time later?
MID_SV_Thermae_Lou_Fia_m01_02: If you're so kind as to invite me, I'd love to.
MID_SV_Thermae_Led_Oly_m01_01: Hmm! All the fighting has given me muscles that I'm\nnot used to from dancing.
MID_SV_Thermae_Led_Oly_m01_02: Yeah. If only you could scrape off a little here, add a\nlittle there, like with clay.
MID_SV_Thermae_Lor1_Nin_m01_01: The spirits here are feeling...effervescent. I could\nalmost float off and away with them.
MID_SV_Thermae_Lor1_Nin_m01_02: N-Ninae, are you feeling OK? You woozy? I told\nyou to drink water before you came here.
MID_SV_Thermae_Ism_m02_01: I feel loose and ready for anything.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai0_m02_01: I feel like I've got more energy.
MID_SV_Thermae_Kai1_m02_01: My mind and body feel new.
MID_SV_Thermae_Dit_m02_01: A pleasurable sensation.
MID_SV_Thermae_Seo_m02_01: The drawback of such a nice bath is that one never\nwants to leave.
MID_SV_Thermae_Led_m02_01: I could almost pass right out.
MID_SV_Thermae_Bel_m02_01: I could have spent even longer in there.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tal_m02_01: Whew! That hit the spot!
MID_SV_Thermae_Anh_m02_01: The warm feelings of the bath still linger.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia0_m02_01: I just want to soak it all up a little longer.
MID_SV_Thermae_Tia1_m02_01: I'm so refreshed.
MID_SV_Thermae_Pet0_m02_01: I feel stronger than ever.
MID_SV_Thermae_Pet1_m02_01: I feel less weighed down.
MID_SV_Thermae_Hur_m02_01: Ah, well that was a delightful pause.
MID_SV_Thermae_Max_m02_01: I feel rejuvenated!
MID_SV_Thermae_Jes_m02_01: Alright, welp—got the blood off.
MID_SV_Thermae_Gol_m02_01: Ready to go smash something!
MID_SV_Thermae_Gat_m02_01: I am soothed in my very spirit.
